{
  "type": "cbm-export",
  "version": 2,
  "generatedAt": "2026-05-26T06:41:38.901Z",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verseText": "你們得救是本乎恩，也因着信；這並不是出於自己，而是神所賜的；",
      "bookName": "以弗所書",
      "chapterNumber": "2",
      "verseNumber": "8",
      "verseInitials": "nmdjsbheyyzxzbbscyzjessscd",
      "bookInitials": "YFSS",
      "bibleVersion": "RCUV",
      "id": "1764382320002"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "也不是出於行為，免得有人自誇。",
      "bookName": "以弗所書",
      "chapterNumber": "2",
      "verseNumber": "9",
      "verseInitials": "ybscyxwmdyrzk",
      "bookInitials": "YFSS",
      "bibleVersion": "RCUV",
      "id": "1764382431930"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "我們是他所造之物，在基督耶穌裏創造的，為要使我們行善，就是神早已預備好要我們做的。",
      "bookName": "以弗所書",
      "chapterNumber": "2",
      "verseNumber": "10",
      "verseInitials": "wmstszzwzjdysczdwyswmxsjsszyybhywmzd",
      "bookInitials": "YFSS",
      "bibleVersion": "RCUV",
      "id": "1764382526795"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "耶穌看見大群的人，就上了山，並坐下，門徒走到祂跟前，",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "1",
      "verseInitials": "yskjdqdrjslsbzxmtzdtgq",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:14:23.188Z",
      "id": "1762753484800",
      "interval": 66,
      "repetitions": 16,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-27T05:14:23.188Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「心靈貧窮的人有福了， 因為天國是他們的。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "3",
      "verseInitials": "xlpqdryflywtgstmd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:14:40.336Z",
      "id": "1762753506517",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-25T05:14:40.336Z",
      "interval": 64,
      "repetitions": 9
    },
    {
      "verseText": "祂就開口教導他們，說：",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "2",
      "verseInitials": "tjkkjdtms",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:14:29.911Z",
      "id": "1762753503251",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-25T05:14:29.911Z",
      "interval": 64,
      "repetitions": 10
    },
    {
      "verseText": "哀慟的人有福了， 因為他們必得安慰。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "4",
      "verseInitials": "atdryflywtmbdaw",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:14:51.717Z",
      "id": "1762753509967",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:14:51.717Z",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 12
    },
    {
      "verseText": "謙和的人有福了， 因為他們必承受土地。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "5",
      "verseInitials": "qhdryflywtmbcstd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:15:25.778Z",
      "id": "1762753513433",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:15:25.778Z",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 7
    },
    {
      "verseText": "切慕公義如饑似渴的人有福了， 因為他們必得飽足。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "6",
      "verseInitials": "qmgyrjskdryflywtmbdbz",
      "bookInitials": "mtfy",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:15:58.540Z",
      "id": "1762753516184",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 14,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:15:58.540Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「人們若因為我的緣故侮辱、迫害、肆意毀謗你們，你們就有福了。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "11",
      "verseInitials": "rmrywwdygwrphsyhbnmnmjyfl",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:18:51.556Z",
      "id": "1762753518900",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 16,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:18:51.556Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "心存憐憫的人有福了， 因為他們必蒙憐憫。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "7",
      "verseInitials": "xclmdryflywtmbmlm",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:16:25.837Z",
      "id": "1762753521151",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 16,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:16:25.837Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "心靈純潔的人有福了， 因為他們必看見上帝。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "8",
      "verseInitials": "xlcjdryflywtmbkjsd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:16:41.571Z",
      "id": "1762753938441",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:16:41.571Z",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 16
    },
    {
      "verseText": "使人和睦的人有福了， 因為他們必被稱為上帝的兒女。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "9",
      "verseInitials": "srhmdryflywtmbbcwsdden",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:17:00.241Z",
      "id": "1762836017227",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:17:00.241Z",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 16
    },
    {
      "verseText": "要歡喜快樂，因為你們在天上有大賞賜。他們也曾這樣迫害以前的先知。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "12",
      "verseInitials": "yhxklywnmztsydsctmyczyphyqdxz",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-05-26T06:36:30.679Z",
      "id": "1762836278620",
      "interval": 1,
      "repetitions": 1,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-27T06:36:30.679Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們是世上的鹽。鹽如果失去鹹味，怎能使它再變鹹呢？它將毫無用處，只會被扔在外面任人踐踏。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "13",
      "verseInitials": "nmsssdyyrgsqxwznstzbxntjhwyczhbrzwmrrjt",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-05-26T06:37:10.712Z",
      "id": "1763781225967",
      "interval": 96,
      "repetitions": 8,
      "dueDate": "2026-08-30T06:37:10.712Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "“你们听过吩咐古人的话，‘不可杀人，杀人的要受审判。’",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "21",
      "verseInitials": "nmtgffgrdhbksrsrdyssp",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-06T02:58:25.500Z",
      "id": "1763807769813",
      "interval": 36,
      "repetitions": 17,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-12T02:58:25.500Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "為義受迫害的人有福了， 因為天國是他們的。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "10",
      "verseInitials": "wysphdryflywtgstmd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:17:19.124Z",
      "id": "1763965724358",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-28T05:17:19.124Z",
      "interval": 67,
      "repetitions": 18
    },
    {
      "verseText": "人點亮燈，不會把它放在斗底下，而是放在燈臺上，好照亮全家。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "15",
      "verseInitials": "rdldbhbtfzddxesfzdtshzlqj",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:28:21.390Z",
      "id": "1764666331261",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-19T07:28:21.390Z",
      "interval": 80,
      "repetitions": 11
    },
    {
      "verseText": "同樣，你們的光也應當照在人面前，好讓他們看見你們的善行，便讚美你們天上的父。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "16",
      "verseInitials": "tynmdgyydzzrmqhrtmkjnmdsxbzmnmtsdf",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:30:34.467Z",
      "id": "1764666492987",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-19T07:30:34.467Z",
      "interval": 80,
      "repetitions": 11
    },
    {
      "verseText": "你們是世上的光。建在山上的城無法隱藏。\n‭",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "14",
      "verseInitials": "nmsssdgjzssdcwfyc",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-05-26T06:37:21.595Z",
      "id": "1764666625078",
      "dueDate": "2026-05-27T06:37:21.595Z",
      "interval": 1,
      "repetitions": 0
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「不要以為我是來廢除律法和先知書，我不是來廢除，而是來成全。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "17",
      "verseInitials": "byywwslfclfhxzswbslfceslcq",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:33:02.662Z",
      "id": "1764731633851",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-19T07:33:02.662Z",
      "interval": 80,
      "repetitions": 11
    },
    {
      "verseText": "我實在告訴你們，就是到天地都消失了，律法的一點一劃都不會廢除，全都要成就。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "18",
      "verseInitials": "wszgsnmjsdtddxsllfdydyhdbhfcqdycj",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:34:48.848Z",
      "id": "1764731879018",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-19T07:34:48.848Z",
      "interval": 80,
      "repetitions": 11
    },
    {
      "verseText": "所以，誰違背這些誡命中最小的一條，並教導別人違背，誰在天國將被稱為最小的。但誰遵守這些誡命，並教導別人遵守，誰在天國將被稱為大的。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "19",
      "verseInitials": "syswbzxjmzzxdytbjdbrwbsztgjbcwzxddszszxjmbjdbrzssztgjbcwdd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:38:47.557Z",
      "id": "1764732333847",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-19T07:38:47.557Z",
      "interval": 80,
      "repetitions": 11
    },
    {
      "verseText": "我告訴你們，你們的義若不勝過律法教師和法利賽人的義，你們絕不能進天國。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "20",
      "verseInitials": "wgsnmnmdyrbsglfjshflsrdynmjbnjtg",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:40:17.288Z",
      "id": "1764732792083",
      "dueDate": "2026-06-19T07:40:17.288Z",
      "interval": 80,
      "repetitions": 11
    },
    {
      "verseText": "所以，你們要愛寄居者，因為你們也曾寄居埃及。",
      "bookName": "申命記",
      "chapterNumber": "10",
      "verseNumber": "19",
      "verseInitials": "synmyajjzywnmycjjaj",
      "bookInitials": "SMJ",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-09T00:49:06.879Z",
      "id": "1764987080560",
      "interval": 96,
      "repetitions": 6,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-13T00:49:06.879Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "但我告訴你們，凡無緣無故向弟兄發怒的，要受審判；凡罵弟兄是白癡的，要受公會的審判；凡罵弟兄是笨蛋的，難逃地獄的火。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "22",
      "verseInitials": "dwgsnmfwywgxdxfndysspfmdxsbcdysghdspfmdxsbddntdydh",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-06T03:02:28.535Z",
      "id": "1765615894950",
      "interval": 36,
      "repetitions": 17,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-12T03:02:28.535Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「所以，你在祭壇前獻祭的時候，要是想起有弟兄和你有過節，",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "23",
      "verseInitials": "synzjtqxjdshysxqydxhnygj",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-06T03:04:19.777Z",
      "id": "1765862756688",
      "interval": 32,
      "repetitions": 6,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-08T03:04:19.777Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "就該把祭物留在祭壇前，先去跟他和好，然後再來獻祭。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "24",
      "verseInitials": "jgbjwlzjtqxqgthhrhzlxj",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-06T03:05:47.499Z",
      "id": "1765862905072",
      "interval": 35,
      "repetitions": 10,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-11T03:05:47.499Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「趁著你和告你的人還在去法庭的路上，你要趕緊與對方和解，以免他把你交給審判官，審判官把你交給差役，把你關進監牢。”",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "25",
      "verseInitials": "cznhgndrhzqftdlsnygjydfhjymtbnjgspgspgbnjgcybngjjl",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-06T03:09:26.971Z",
      "id": "1765863090929",
      "interval": 35,
      "repetitions": 10,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-11T03:09:26.971Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "我實在告訴你，要是有一分錢沒有還清，你絕不能從那裡出來。\n‭‭",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "26",
      "verseInitials": "wszgsnysyyfqmyhqnjbncnlcl",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-06T03:10:12.110Z",
      "id": "1765865074251",
      "interval": 35,
      "repetitions": 9,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-11T03:10:12.110Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們聽過這樣的話，『不可通姦。』",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "27",
      "verseInitials": "nmtgzydhbktj",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T13:21:28.428Z",
      "id": "1766665265902",
      "interval": 45,
      "repetitions": 26,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-06T13:21:28.428Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "但我告訴你們，凡看見婦女就動淫念的，他在心裡已經犯了通姦罪。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "28",
      "verseInitials": "dwgsnmfkjfnjdyndtzxlyjfltjz",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T13:24:19.957Z",
      "id": "1766665500544",
      "interval": 45,
      "repetitions": 29,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-06T13:24:19.957Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "如果你的右眼使你犯罪，就剜掉它！寧可失去身體的一部分，也比整個人被扔進地獄好。‬‬",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "29",
      "verseInitials": "rgndyysnfzjwdtnksqstdybfybzgrbrjdyh",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T13:35:14.257Z",
      "id": "1767277728662",
      "interval": 45,
      "repetitions": 27,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-06T13:35:14.257Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "如果你的右手使你犯罪，就砍掉它！寧可失去身體的一部分，也比整個人下地獄好。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "30",
      "verseInitials": "rgndyssnfzjkdtnksqstdybfybzgrxdyh",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T13:35:58.302Z",
      "id": "1767337467041",
      "interval": 45,
      "repetitions": 26,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-06T13:35:58.302Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「還有話說，『人若休妻，必須給她休書』。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "31",
      "verseInitials": "hyhsrrxqbxgtxs",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T06:31:52.534Z",
      "id": "1767405916780",
      "interval": 1,
      "repetitions": 0,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-23T13:37:40.034Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "但我告訴你們，除非是妻子不貞，否則休妻就是使妻子犯通姦罪，娶被休的女子也是犯通姦罪。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "32",
      "verseInitials": "dwgsnmcfsqzbzfzxqjssqzftjzqbxdnzysftjz",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T13:41:30.711Z",
      "id": "1767406144313",
      "interval": 6,
      "repetitions": 2,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-28T13:41:30.711Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們也聽過吩咐古人的話，『不可違背誓言，總要向主遵守所起的誓。』",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "33",
      "verseInitials": "nmytgffgrdhbkwbsyzyxzzssqds",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-21T08:52:25.997Z",
      "id": "1767675953941",
      "interval": 24,
      "repetitions": 4,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-15T08:52:25.997Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "但我告訴你們，不可起誓。不可指著天起誓，因為天是上帝的寶座。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "34",
      "verseInitials": "dwgsnmbkqsbkzztqsywtssddbz",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-21T08:52:57.846Z",
      "id": "1767742049076",
      "interval": 42,
      "repetitions": 19,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-02T08:52:57.846Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "不可指著地起誓，因為地是上帝的腳凳。不可指著耶路撒冷起誓，因為那是大君王的城。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "35",
      "verseInitials": "bkzzdqsywdssddjdbkzzylslqsywnsdjwdc",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-21T08:53:41.279Z",
      "id": "1767742283885",
      "interval": 42,
      "repetitions": 18,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-02T08:53:41.279Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "也不可指著自己的頭起誓，因為你不能使一根頭髮變白或變黑。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "36",
      "verseInitials": "ybkzzzjdtqsywnbnsygtfbbhbh",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-21T08:54:18.342Z",
      "id": "1767742458359",
      "interval": 42,
      "repetitions": 11,
      "dueDate": "2026-06-02T08:54:18.342Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "你們說話，是就說是，不是就說不是，多說的便是來自那惡者。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "37",
      "verseInitials": "nmshsjssbsjsbsdsdbslznez",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-21T08:55:44.575Z",
      "id": "1767742596098",
      "interval": 24,
      "repetitions": 4,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-15T08:55:44.575Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們聽過這樣的話，『以眼還眼，以牙還牙。』",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "38",
      "verseInitials": "nmtgzydhyyhyyyhy",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:33:31.906Z",
      "id": "1768898996986",
      "interval": 6,
      "repetitions": 3,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-25T13:33:31.906Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "但我告訴你們，不要跟惡人作對。有人打你的右臉，連左臉也轉過來讓他打。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "39",
      "verseInitials": "dwgsnmbygerzdyrdndyllzlyzglrtd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:34:28.122Z",
      "id": "1768899166945",
      "interval": 18,
      "repetitions": 26,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-07T13:34:28.122Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "有人想控告你，要奪你的內衣，連外衣也給他。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "40",
      "verseInitials": "yrxkgnydndnylwyygt",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:35:10.320Z",
      "id": "1768899298399",
      "interval": 18,
      "repetitions": 20,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-07T13:35:10.320Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "有人強迫你走一里路，你就跟他走二里路。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "41",
      "verseInitials": "yrqpnzyllnjgtzell",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:35:31.283Z",
      "id": "1768899534730",
      "interval": 1,
      "repetitions": 1,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-20T13:35:31.283Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "有求你的，就給他；有向你借的，不可拒絕他。‬‬",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "42",
      "verseInitials": "yqndjgtyxnjdbkjjt",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:36:07.262Z",
      "id": "1768899646203",
      "interval": 18,
      "repetitions": 17,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-07T13:36:07.262Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們聽過這樣的話，『要愛鄰居，恨仇敵。』",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "43",
      "verseInitials": "nmtgzydhyaljhcd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:36:27.228Z",
      "id": "1768899748903",
      "interval": 18,
      "repetitions": 17,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-07T13:36:27.228Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "但我告訴你們，要愛你們的仇敵，為迫害你們的人禱告。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "44",
      "verseInitials": "dwgsnmyanmdcdwphnmdrdg",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:38:19.877Z",
      "id": "1768899871206",
      "interval": 12,
      "repetitions": 7,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-01T13:38:19.877Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "這樣，你們才是天父的孩子。因為祂讓陽光照好人也照壞人，降雨給義人也給惡人。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "45",
      "verseInitials": "zynmcstfdhzywtrygzhryzhrjygyryger",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:39:04.576Z",
      "id": "1768902996126",
      "interval": 24,
      "repetitions": 10,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-13T13:39:04.576Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "如果你們只愛那些愛你們的人，有什麼值得嘉獎的呢？就是稅吏也會這樣做。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "46",
      "verseInitials": "rgnmzanxanmdrysmzdjjdnjsslyhzyz",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:39:49.834Z",
      "id": "1768903199273",
      "interval": 24,
      "repetitions": 10,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-13T13:39:49.834Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "如果你們只問候自己的弟兄，有什麼特別呢？就是外族人也會這樣做。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "47",
      "verseInitials": "rgnmzwhzjddxysmtbnjswzryhzyz",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:40:43.234Z",
      "id": "1768903874259",
      "interval": 6,
      "repetitions": 2,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-25T13:40:43.234Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "所以，你們要純全，正如你們的天父是純全的。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "5",
      "verseNumber": "48",
      "verseInitials": "synmycqzrnmdtfscqd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-19T13:41:18.082Z",
      "id": "1768904069171",
      "interval": 12,
      "repetitions": 5,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-01T13:41:18.082Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們要小心，行義的時候不可張揚，故意叫人看見，否則就不能得你們天父的賞賜了。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "6",
      "verseNumber": "1",
      "verseInitials": "nmyxxxydshbkzygyjrkjfzjbndnmtfdscl",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:11:29.352Z",
      "id": "1768904463128",
      "interval": 6,
      "repetitions": 3,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-28T05:11:29.352Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "我靠著那加給我力量的，凡事都能做。",
      "bookName": "腓立比書",
      "chapterNumber": "4",
      "verseNumber": "13",
      "verseInitials": "wkznjgwlldfsdnz",
      "bookInitials": "FLBS",
      "bibleVersion": "RCUV",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-11T03:34:47.106Z",
      "id": "1771814050825",
      "interval": 32,
      "repetitions": 6,
      "dueDate": "2026-05-13T03:34:47.106Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「因此，賙濟窮人的時候，不要大吹大擂，像那些偽君子在會堂和街市上所行的一樣，以博取人們的讚賞。我實在告訴你們，他們得到的賞賜僅此而已。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "6",
      "verseNumber": "2",
      "verseInitials": "yczjqrdshbydcdlxnxwjzzhthjsssxdyyybqrmdzswszgsnmtmdddscjcey",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-04-22T05:13:32.748Z",
      "id": "1772295084587",
      "interval": 6,
      "repetitions": 2,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-28T05:13:32.748Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "在我生命中收到过很多份礼物，但是我难忘的礼物，就是我哥哥给我的那个空纸箱。",
      "bookName": "礼物故事",
      "chapterNumber": "1",
      "verseNumber": "16",
      "verseInitials": "zwsmzsdghdflwdswnwdlwjswgggwdngkzx",
      "bookInitials": "lwgs",
      "bibleVersion": "",
      "lastReviewed": "2026-03-31T07:42:39.744Z",
      "id": "1772499263787",
      "interval": 24,
      "repetitions": 5,
      "dueDate": "2026-04-24T07:42:39.744Z"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "销售人员在推销时，都让顾客尝试运用他的产品，有的甚至送一套产品让顾客使用。为什么？",
      "bookName": "应用",
      "chapterNumber": "1",
      "verseNumber": "2",
      "verseInitials": "xsryztxsdrgkcsyytdcpydszsytcprgksywsm",
      "bookInitials": "yy",
      "bibleVersion": "",
      "lastReviewed": null,
      "id": "1772609193587"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "你們賙濟窮人的時候，右手所做的別叫左手知道，",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "6",
      "verseNumber": "3",
      "verseInitials": "nmzjqrdshysszdbjzszd",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": null,
      "id": "1774945205583"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "要不聲不響地去做。這樣，鑒察隱祕事的天父必賞賜你們。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "6",
      "verseNumber": "4",
      "verseInitials": "ybsbxdqzzyjcymsdtfbscnm",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": null,
      "id": "1774945528225"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "「你們禱告時，不要像偽君子那樣。他們喜歡站在會堂裡和十字路口上公開禱告，故意讓人看見。我實在告訴你們，他們得到的賞賜不過是人的讚賞。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "6",
      "verseNumber": "5",
      "verseInitials": "nmdgsbyxwjznytmxhzzhtlhszlksgkdggyrrkjwszgsnmtmdddscbgsrdzs",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": null,
      "id": "1774947536442"
    },
    {
      "verseText": "你們禱告的時候，要進入內室，關上門，向你們肉眼看不見的父祈禱，鑒察隱祕事的父必賞賜你們。",
      "bookName": "馬太福音",
      "chapterNumber": "6",
      "verseNumber": "6",
      "verseInitials": "nmdgdshyjrnsgsmxnmrykbjdfqdjcymsdfbscnm",
      "bookInitials": "MTFY",
      "bibleVersion": "CCB",
      "lastReviewed": null,
      "id": "1774947715323"
    }
  ],
